"The %lld old commits are gone from this repository." = "Los %lld commits antiguos ya no están en este repositorio.";
"The %lld selected commits" = "Los %lld commits seleccionados";
"The branches and tags go back to the old commits — if none of them has moved since." = "Las ramas y etiquetas vuelven a los commits antiguos — si ninguna se ha movido desde entonces.";
"The commit messages were last rewritten on %@. The old commits are kept so that it can be undone." = "Los mensajes de commit se reescribieron por última vez el %@. Los commits antiguos se conservan para poder deshacerlo.";
"The current branch" = "La rama actual";
"The history could not be read. Nothing was changed." = "No se ha podido leer el historial. No se ha cambiado nada.";
"The message of %@ is not stored as UTF-8 and cannot be changed here." = "El mensaje de %@ no está guardado como UTF-8 y no se puede cambiar aquí.";
"The message of %@ would be empty. A commit needs a message." = "El mensaje de %@ quedaría vacío. Un commit necesita un mensaje.";
"The regular expression is not valid." = "La expresión regular no es válida.";
"The remote branches are replaced by the rewritten ones — with a lease: if somebody pushed to them since they were fetched, the push is refused instead." = "Las ramas remotas se sustituyen por las reescritas — con arrendamiento: si alguien envió a ellas desde la última obtención, el envío se rechaza en su lugar.";
"The selected commit" = "El commit seleccionado";
"There is no backup of that rewrite any more." = "Ya no hay copia de seguridad de esa reescritura.";
"This is about this repository only. Commits that were pushed may still be reachable at the server — through pull requests, forks or caches — and in every clone. A secret that was pushed has to be revoked or changed." = "Esto afecta solo a este repositorio. Los commits enviados pueden seguir siendo accesibles en el servidor — a través de pull requests, forks o cachés — y en cada clon. Un secreto que se envió debe revocarse o cambiarse.";
"Undo" = "Deshacer";
"Undo the rewrite of the commit messages?" = "¿Deshacer la reescritura de los mensajes de commit?";
"Undone: %@ are back on the old commits." = "Deshecho: %@ vuelven a estar en los commits antiguos.";
"Was: %@" = "Antes: %@";
"Whole words" = "Palabras completas";
"edited" = "editado";
"in %lld commit(s)" = "en %lld commit(s)";
"left as it is" = "dejado como está";
"pushed." = "enviado.";
"%@ still has the old commits. Force-push the rewritten branches first; removing the old commits before that would make the force-push impossible." = "%@ todavía tiene los commits antiguos. Fuerza primero el envío de las ramas reescritas; eliminar los commits antiguos antes haría imposible el envío forzado.";
"A fetch is running in this repository. Try again when it has finished." = "Hay un fetch en curso en este repositorio. Vuelve a intentarlo cuando termine.";
"only the newest %lld commits are searched" = "solo se buscan los %lld commits más recientes";
